 "intro_html": "Crisp and sweet-sour. Salting pulls the water out; rinsing takes the salt back off so the marinade does the seasoning. Ginger, garlic and a splash of rice vinegar go in first, then the vinegar–mirin–sugar marinade, with light soy and sesame at the very end. No rice vinegar for the marinade? Pick your vinegar below — the amounts update to match.",
